B.U1=s(["Ka\u011fan Ota\u011f\u0131n\u0131 Seviye 5 veya \xfczerine y\xfckseltin.","Fethedilmi\u015f bo\u015f bir karoya dokunup \u0130N\u015eA ET men\xfcs\xfcnden SAVUNMA KULES\u0130 se\xe7in.","Kuleleri d\xfc\u015fmanlar\u0131n y\xfcr\xfcy\xfc\u015f koridorlar\u0131n\u0131 \xe7apraz ate\u015fe alacak \u015fekilde konu\u015fland\u0131r\u0131n.","Kuleyi y\xfckselterek at\u0131\u015f hasar\u0131n\u0131 ve menzil g\xfcc\xfcn\xfc art\u0131r\u0131n."],t.s)
