B.W1=s(["Sur ile kuleyi ayn\u0131 savunma hatt\u0131nda birle\u015ftirin; d\xfc\u015fman suru k\u0131rmaya \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131rken kule onlar\u0131 yok eder.","Kuleler gece ak\u0131nlar\u0131nda ayd\u0131nlatma me\u015falesi yayarak sava\u015f atmosferini canland\u0131r\u0131r."],t.s)
