B.QK=new A.bu("defense_watchtower",B.j2,"G\xf6zc\xfc Savunma Kulesi & Ok\xe7ular","Watchtower & Defense Turrets","Seviye 5 Ka\u011fan Ota\u011f\u0131 ile a\xe7\u0131lan, 3 Hex menzilli otomatik savunma kulesi. D\xfc\u015fmanlara parabolik 3D voksel oklar f\u0131rlat\u0131r.","Unlocks at Castle Level 5. Automatically fires parabolic 3D voxel arrows at incoming enemies within a 3-hex radius.","Savunma Kulesi, Bozk\u0131r Ak\u0131nlar\u0131na kar\u015f\u0131 en g\xfc\xe7l\xfc aktif savunma yap\u0131s\u0131d\u0131r. 3 Hex menzil i\xe7erisindeki en yak\u0131n d\xfc\u015fman\u0131 otomatik hedefler ve parabolik yayla s\xfcz\xfclen 3D voksel oklar f\u0131rlat\u0131r. Kule seviyesi artt\u0131k\xe7a ok hasar\u0131 katlan\u0131r (15 -> 30 -> 60 -> 120 -> 240+ Hasar) ve Seviye 5+ kuleler alevli manc\u0131n\u0131k g\xfcllesi atarak alan hasar\u0131 (AoE) vurmaya ba\u015flar.","The Watchtower is your main tactical defense structure. It automatically locks onto marching enemies within a 3-hex range and shoots voxel arrows along an arc. Upgrading increases damage significantly, and Level 5+ towers launch fiery catapult boulders with area-of-effect (AoE) blast damage.",B.j3,B.Q,"KULE / OK\xc7U (R=3)",B.a1y,B.U1,B.YO,B.W1,B.UL,B.Vf)
