B.VA=s(["Sa\u011fdaki mor Diyar Se\xe7imi butonuna dokunun.","Kazanaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131z Tamga miktar\u0131n\u0131 ve Kurgan miras\u0131n\u0131 inceleyin.","G\xd6\xc7\xdc BA\u015eLAT butonuna basarak yeni topraklarda daha g\xfc\xe7l\xfc bir ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 yap\u0131n."],t.s)
B.V5=s(["Tap the purple Realm Migration button on the right toolbar.","Review your earned Tamga count and Kurgan relics.","Tap INITIATE MIGRATION to start fresh with permanent prestige multipliers."],t.s)
B.Zz=s(["G\xf6\xe7 etmeden \xf6nce Ka\u011fan Ota\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ve ana binalar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 m\xfcmk\xfcn olan en y\xfcksek seviyeye \xe7\u0131kar\u0131n; b\xf6ylece Atalar Kurgan\u0131n\u0131z \xe7ok daha g\xfc\xe7l\xfc miras bonusu verir."],t.s)
